<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#080b12">
    <meta name="description" content="MAKTAB AI CONTROL — maktab Kelajak o'quvchilar kengashi faoliyatini boshqarish va sun'iy intellekt bilan tahlil qilish platformasi.">
    <title>MAKTAB AI CONTROL | Bosh sahifa</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #080b12;
            --panel: rgba(17, 23, 37, .82);
            --gold: #e9c46a;
            --blue: #38bdf8;
            --green: #4ade80;
            --text: #f4f7fb;
            --muted: #9ca9bc;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 10%, rgba(56,189,248,.13), transparent 38%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 25%, rgba(233,196,106,.10), transparent 32%),
                var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        button, a {
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(1160px, 92%);
            margin: auto;
        }

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(8,11,18,.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .navbar {
            min-height: 76px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .brand-icon {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #202b42, #0d111b);
            border: 1px solid rgba(233,196,106,.45);
            box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(233,196,106,.08);
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 1.1px;
        }

        .brand-subtitle {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 28px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 9px;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: .2s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            color: #10131a;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5d98b, #d5a83d);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(233,196,106,.13);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            border-color: rgba(56,189,248,.38);
            background: rgba(56,189,248,.06);
            color: var(--blue);
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 590px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 60px;
            padding-top: 75px;
            padding-bottom: 75px;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
            color: var(--green);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.7px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,.2);
            background: rgba(74,222,128,.06);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 9px 13px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            background: var(--green);
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--green);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(37px, 5.2vw, 65px);
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        h1 span {
            display: block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), #fff0bd, var(--blue));
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-description {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            max-width: 590px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 13px;
        }

        .hero-note {
            margin-top: 24px;
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .visual {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 390px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
        }

        .orbit {
            position: absolute;
            width: 330px;
            height: 330px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,.18);
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 70px rgba(56,189,248,.06),
                        inset 0 0 60px rgba(56,189,248,.04);
        }

        .orbit::before,
        .orbit::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            border: 1px solid rgba(233,196,106,.15);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .orbit::before {
            inset: 25px;
        }

        .orbit::after {
            inset: 55px;
        }

        .core {
            position: relative;
            width: 190px;
            height: 220px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,.4);
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(22,37,57,.96), rgba(10,14,24,.98));
            box-shadow: 0 0 65px rgba(56,189,248,.13),
                        inset 0 0 35px rgba(56,189,248,.06);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .core-symbol {
            font-size: 55px;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(233,196,106,.4);
        }

        .core-title {
            margin-top: 13px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .core-caption {
            color: var(--blue);
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .floating-card {
            position: absolute;
            padding: 14px 17px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: rgba(15,21,34,.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
        }

        .floating-card strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .floating-card small {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .card-one {
            top: 42px;
            right: -4px;
        }

        .card-two {
            bottom: 40px;
            left: -5px;
        }

        .card-icon {
            color: var(--blue);
            margin-right: 6px;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }

        .section {
            padding: 65px 0;
        }

        .section-heading {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 38px;
        }

        .section-heading .mini {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 13px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: clamp(25px, 3.3vw, 37px);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .section-heading p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 27px;
            border-radius: 19px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(19,26,41,.88), rgba(11,15,24,.8));
            transition: .25s ease;
        }

        .feature:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: rgba(56,189,248,.3);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 47px;
            height: 47px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 22px;
            background: rgba(56,189,248,.09);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,.16);
        }

        .feature h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .feature p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        .cta {
            margin: 50px auto 80px;
            padding: 42px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(233,196,106,.22);
            border-radius: 24px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(233,196,106,.09), transparent 65%),
                rgba(16,21,32,.75);
        }

        .cta p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin: 13px auto 24px;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 25px 0;
            color: #778397;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .footer-inner {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 20px;
                padding-top: 65px;
            }

            .visual {
                min-height: 360px;
            }

            .features {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .card-one {
                right: 2%;
            }

            .card-two {
                left: 2%;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .brand-name {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .brand-subtitle {
                font-size: 8px;
            }

            .navbar > .btn {
                padding: 11px 13px;
                font-size: 12px;
            }

            h1 {
                letter-spacing: -1.2px;
            }

            .hero-description {
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .orbit {
                width: 270px;
                height: 270px;
            }

            .core {
                width: 160px;
                height: 190px;
            }

            .floating-card {
                padding: 11px;
            }

            .floating-card strong {
                font-size: 10px;
            }

            .floating-card small {
                font-size: 9px;
            }

            .cta {
                padding: 28px 18px;
            }

            .footer-inner {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                animation-duration: .01ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                transition-duration: .01ms !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container navbar">
            <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="MAKTAB AI CONTROL bosh sahifa">
                <div class="brand-icon">T</div>
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-name">MAKTAB AI CONTROL</div>
                    <div class="brand-subtitle">SMART EDUCATION SYSTEM</div>
                </div>
            </a>

            <nav class="nav-links">
                <a href="#imkoniyatlar">Imkoniyatlar</a>
                <a href="#haqida">Loyiha haqida</a>
            </nav>

            <!-- MUHIM: Kirish tugmasi /login ga boradi -->
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/login">
                Kirish <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="container hero" id="haqida">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">
                    <span class="status-dot"></span>
                    TA'LIM UCHUN YANGI AVLOD PLATFORMASI
                </div>

                <h1>
                    Ta'lim boshqaruvi
                    <span>yangi bosqichda.</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="hero-description">
                    MAKTAB AI CONTROL — Kelajak lideri, yetti yo'nalish
                    koordinatorlari, maktab maslahatchisi va direktor uchun
                    yagona raqamli boshqaruv tizimi. Topshiriq va hisobotlarni
                    kuzating, natijalarni solishtiring va sun'iy intellekt
                    tavsiyalaridan foydalaning.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/login">
                        Platformaga kirish <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                    </a>

                    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#imkoniyatlar">
                        Imkoniyatlarni ko'rish
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-note">
                    ◆ Markazlashgan boshqaruv &nbsp; ◆ Rol asosidagi kirish
                    &nbsp; ◆ AI yordamchisi
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="visual" aria-label="MAKTAB AI CONTROL platformasi tasviri">
                <div class="orbit"></div>

                <div class="core">
                    <div class="core-symbol">✦</div>
                    <div class="core-title">MAKTAB AI</div>
                    <div class="core-caption">INTELLIGENCE CORE</div>
                </div>

                <div class="floating-card card-one">
                    <strong><span class="card-icon">✦</span> AI ANALITIKA</strong>
                    <small>Ma'lumotlardan xulosa chiqarish</small>
                </div>

                <div class="floating-card card-two">
                    <strong><span class="card-icon">◈</span> YAGONA TIZIM</strong>
                    <small>Yetti yo'nalish va bitta kengash</small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="imkoniyatlar">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div class="mini">PLATFORMA IMKONIYATLARI</div>
                    <h2>Barcha jarayonlar — bir joyda</h2>
                    <p>
                        Ta'lim muassasalaridagi ishlarni tizimli kuzatish,
                        muvofiqlashtirish va tahlil qilish uchun yaratilgan
                        raqamli platforma.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="features">
                    <article class="feature">
                        <div class="feature-icon">🏫</div>
                        <h3>Kengash boshqaruvi</h3>
                        <p>
                            Kelajak o'quvchilar kengashi faoliyatini
                            markazlashgan tarzda yuritish va kerakli ma'lumotni
                            tegishli mas'ullarga taqdim etish.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="feature">
                        <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
                        <h3>Yo'nalishlar va koordinatorlar</h3>
                        <p>
                            Ta'lim, media, madaniyat, ekologiya, sport,
                            IT va ijtimoiy tashabbuslar: har bir koordinator
                            faqat o'z yo'nalishi doirasida ishlaydi.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="feature">
                        <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
                        <h3>Sun'iy intellekt</h3>
                        <p>
                            Ma'lumotlarni tahlil qilish, muammolarni
                            aniqlash va qaror qabul qilish jarayonida
                            yordam beruvchi AI imkoniyatlari.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="feature">
                        <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
                        <h3>Hisobotlar va tahlil</h3>
                        <p>
                            Hisobotlar holatini kuzatish, natijalarni
                            ko'rish va boshqaruv uchun zarur
                            ma'lumotlarni bir joyda jamlash.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="feature">
                        <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
                        <h3>Vazifalar nazorati</h3>
                        <p>
                            Vazifalarni belgilash, bajarilish holatini
                            kuzatish va mas'ullar o'rtasida
                            muvofiqlashtirish.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="feature">
                        <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
                        <h3>Xavfsiz kirish</h3>
                        <p>
                            Foydalanuvchi rollari va ruxsatlar orqali
                            har bir hisobning imkoniyatlarini
                            server tomonida nazorat qilish.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="container">
            <div class="cta">
                <div class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                    <div class="mini">MAKTAB AI CONTROL</div>
                    <h2>Raqamli boshqaruvni boshlang</h2>
                </div>

                <p>
                    Platformaga o'z hisobingiz orqali kiring va
                    sizga biriktirilgan imkoniyatlardan foydalaning.
                </p>

                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/login">
                    Kirish sahifasiga o'tish →
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-inner">
            <div>
                <span class="footer-brand">MAKTAB AI CONTROL</span>
                <span> — Smart Education System</span>
            </div>

            <div>
                © <span id="year"></span> MAKTAB AI CONTROL
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.getElementById("year").textContent =
            new Date().getFullYear();

        // Kirish tugmalari /login sahifasiga olib boradi.
        // API hujjatlari (/docs) bosh sahifadagi kirish tugmasi bilan bog'lanmagan.
    </script>
</body>
</html>